{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-10-10T08:23:21.085Z","data":{"text":"Task complete. Summary:\n\n**Implemented `archived` next-step state and `Not landed` status section**\n\n- `src/core/status/next-step.ts`\n  - `NextStepState` now includes `archived`.\n  - `readArchivedNextStep` checks steering first (still `dead`), then with `vcs.enabled` + git port calls `readDependencyState` for the folder; anything but `landed` yields `{ state: 'archived', command: 'osq land <id>', detail: 'not landed' }`. Flag off / no git keeps `landed` and reads nothing from git.\n  - Added `@scenario status-inspection:` tags.\n\n- `src/core/status/status.ts`\n  - Added exported `NotLandedChange` and optional `StatusOverview.notLanded`.\n  - `getStatusOverview` now derives `notLanded` from `findLandCandidates` + `readNextStep`, in numeric order, only when `vcs.enabled`; omits the key when empty.\n  - `formatStatusOverview` prints `Not landed:` / `  <id>: <title> — osq land <id>` directly after `Archived specs: <n>`.\n\n- `tests/landed-next-step.test.ts` (new)\n  - Covers all scenarios of \"Landed next step reads the default branch\", \"Changes waiting to land in status\", and \"Not landed format\" using temp git repos with worktree-archived changes, `git merge` for landed cases, and a `sync_conflict` stop for the steering case.\n\n**Verification**\n- Task verify `node --import tsx --import ./tests/git-test-env.ts --test tests/landed-next-step.test.ts`: 6/6 pass.\n- Proposal verify `pnpm verify`: exit 0 (typechecks, build, all CLI + UI tests, lint).\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/164-landed-means-on-main/.run/results/1.md`."}}
